11
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Never mind that. We need to hurry. They'll be coming after us.

12
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,000
See, I was planning to try that thing they do in the movies.

13
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,000
You know where they tunnel under the wall by using a spoon to steadily dig away at the ground underneath it?

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:23,000
I always thought that was a really cool idea when they did that. So, I decided I would give it a try myself.

15
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
But all they ever gave me was chopsticks!

16
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:32,000
You can't dig with those!

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:37,000
I tried to think of another way out. I thought about it all the time.

18
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,000
And I realized something. I'm just not an idea man.

19
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,000
I suppose it doesn't matter now, but you could have peed on the bars of your cell every day and gradually corroded them away, right?

20
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Oh, damn it! Why did I try that? I'm such an idiot!

21
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
We have to hurry! They're coming after us!

22
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
If your hands and feet are still shackled like that, you can't fight and we'll...

