00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,160
Ah!

280
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:05,160
Ah!

281
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:06,160
Ah!

282
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,160
Ah!

283
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,160
Ah!

284
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,160
What?

285
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,160
It's like before.

286
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:14,160
That time when Blackstar and Soul were fighting kids.

287
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:17,160
Blackstar tried to lift Soul, but couldn't.

288
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:19,160
And this time, Soul's handle burned Maka.

289
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:22,160
I don't think their Soul wavelengths are in sync.

290
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:31,160
Poor Soul Eater, with all that black blood still inside of you.

291
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:36,160
How are you and your precious Maestro Maka going to handle this turn of events, I wonder?

292
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:39,160
And so, the experiment begins.

293
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:55,160
So difficult to breathe.

294
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:57,160
Why is this happening?

295
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:59,160
How do I breathe again?

296
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:01,160
Just inhale and exhale, right?

297
00:14:01,160 --> 00:14:03,160
And how do I use my weapon?

298
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:05,160
Fighting won't miss.

299
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,160
Let's go!

300
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:09,160
Maka!

301
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:10,160
I'm Zillinger!

302
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,160
Soul!

303
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:28,160
Magic Eye Cannon!

304
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:36,160
Dammit, that was not good.

305
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:39,160
I always forget not to put those things where they can skewer me.

306
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:40,160
But it's okay.

307
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:41,160
No problem at all.

308
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,160
Nothing to see here.

309
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:46,160
After all, I'm immortal.

310
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:50,160
He's an immortal magic werewolf.

311
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:54,160
I can't deny that this guy is strong, but he sure is clumsy.

312
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:57,160
I guess sitting in a witch prison for 200 years would make anyone rusty.

313
00:14:57,160 --> 00:15:00,160
I can't seem to handle my magic as well as I used to.

314
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,160
Maka!

315
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,160
We have to do something!

316
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:04,160
If you can't use Soul, try fighting with me!

317
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,160
It won't work.

318
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:11,160
Even if I could figure out how to use you in time, I still wouldn't be able to defeat him.

319
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:14,160
You Meisters.

320
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:17,160
The Great Lord Death plays by his own rules.

321
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:20,160
It's those rules that decide what evil is.

322
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:21,160
What are you talking about?

323
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:24,160
You all follow the Reaper so blindly.

324
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:28,160
What gives him the right to decide how the world should be run?

325
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:34,160
He trains you to hunt down souls he believes are unworthy, and a soul like mine wouldn't be safe from him.

326
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:37,160
But I for one am not going to accept that kind of future.

327
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:39,160
I refuse!

328
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:41,160
It's my turn now.

329
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:43,160
I'm gonna be the judge!

330
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:46,160
I'm not gonna play by his rules anymore!

331
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:50,160
Maka!

332
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:59,160
Soul, transform back into a scythe.

333
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,160
Wait, Maka.

334
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:02,160
You couldn't even hold me before.

335
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,160
Do it!

336
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:08,160
Using a weapon when your wavelengths aren't in sync is incredibly hard on the mind as well as the body.

337
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:09,160
But what else can she do?

338
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:12,160
Maka is a scythe-meister and Soul is her weapon.

339
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,160
Maka, your hands!

340
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,160
I'm going to become...

341
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:23,160
stronger!

342
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:25,160
Take that!

343
00:16:26,160 --> 00:16:27,160
You'll have to do better than that.

344
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:30,160
How fast!

345
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,160
Damn!

346
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,160
What are you doing?

347
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:36,160
Calm down!

348
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:37,160
Take a breath!

349
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,160
Stay out of it!

350
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:39,160
I'm going to do this!

351
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:40,160
I refuse to let him defeat me!

352
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:42,160
Don't be an idiot!

353
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:45,160
If Shadow like a spoiled brat made you stronger, everyone would do it!

354
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:46,160
Shut up!

355
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:49,160
It's because of you saying stuff like that that our wavelengths are out of sync!

356
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:51,160
That's not cool, Soul!

357
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:52,160
It isn't cool at all!

358
00:16:53,160 --> 00:16:54,160
Gain power!

359
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:57,160
I can show you how if you need!

360
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:59,160
Shut your mouth, Maka!

361
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:01,160
What do you even know anyway?

362
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:03,160
That was enough, you two!

363
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,160
You guys are a team!

364
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,160
You have to work together if you want to do anything!

365
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,160
One person can't make a decision without the other!

366
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:14,160
You decide together and you fight together!

367
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,160
Right!

368
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:18,160
Like Blackstar stopped to consult you every time he's about to do something stupid!

369
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:22,160
I'll admit Blackstar makes some dumb calls from time to time,

370
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:26,160
but the important thing is I'm here to back him up no matter how big a fool he is!

371
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:29,160
If we're fools, we're fools together! That's the kind of team we are!

372
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,160
Maybe Tsubaki's right.

373
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:37,160
I want to become stronger, but there's no reason I have to do it alone.

374
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:42,160
All I've been thinking about this whole time was catching up to Soul somehow.

375
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:48,160
No matter how hot it gets, I'm not letting go.

376
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:51,160
Soul and I are going to grow stronger together!

377
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:58,160
I don't get what you've been so worried about. I'm not even all that strong.

378
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:02,160
If you're done telling me what to do, maybe we can work together now.

379
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:05,160
Hey, demon guy.

380
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:08,160
You can lead me wherever you want.

381
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:11,160
Let's hear your plan, and we'll see whether I follow him.

382
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:16,160
In that case, come with me. Overwhelming madness and power await.

383
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:18,160
You got it.

384
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:22,160
Let's go! Soul Resonance!

385
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,160
Excellent.

386
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:35,160
Finally, the Black Blood is starting to do its work.

387
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:38,160
Wow! Their Soul Resonance rate is incredible!

388
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:44,160
What's happening? Something's wrong.

389
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,160
Is Soul devouring me?

390
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:52,160
This should be interesting. A weapon with Black Blood has the power to swallow its Meister's mind.

391
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:56,160
Now, let's see you raise your Resonance rate even higher.

392
00:18:57,160 --> 00:19:00,160
Damn! It feels like my consciousness is being carried away!

393
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,160
No!

394
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:05,160
I won't let it. I will stay in control!

395
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:13,160
The legendary super skill of the Scythe Meister!

396
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,160
Witch Meister!

397
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,160
Fenty Tecnic, mindpying me.

398
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,440
Mine might be.

399
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:23,520
Woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof-woof.

400
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:24,760
We can get past that!

401
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:27,680
Ha-aaaah!

402
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,180
Ah!

403
00:19:34,260 --> 00:19:39,560
It doesn't hurt. It's not hot. I'm not scared. I will not be beaten.

404
00:19:39,560 --> 00:19:42,500
I won't ever let Sol get hurt again.

405
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:46,060
I'm going to get stronger!

406
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:48,060
Figure six, Hunter!

407
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:51,060
What the hell?!

408
00:19:51,060 --> 00:19:52,060
We get him?

409
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:53,060
Almost there.

410
00:19:54,060 --> 00:19:57,060
A Meister throwing her weapon aside and attacking!

411
00:19:57,060 --> 00:19:58,060
Maka!

412
00:19:58,060 --> 00:19:59,060
Maka!

413
00:20:01,060 --> 00:20:02,060
Down you go!

414
00:20:05,060 --> 00:20:06,060
Soul!

415
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:09,060
I guess your ankles aren't that fat.

416
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:12,060
Maka!

417
00:20:12,060 --> 00:20:15,060
If you think I'm falling all by myself, think again.

418
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:17,060
I'm taking you with me!

419
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:18,060
Maka!

420
00:20:18,060 --> 00:20:19,060
Damn!

421
00:20:19,060 --> 00:20:21,060
There's no way I'm letting you go!

422
00:20:25,060 --> 00:20:26,060
Yahoo!

423
00:20:28,060 --> 00:20:30,060
It's a good thing I'm here to look out for you two!

424
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:33,060
This isn't over yet!

425
00:20:33,060 --> 00:20:36,060
Wolf wolves, wolf wolves, wolf wolves!

426
00:20:36,060 --> 00:20:40,060
I'll just make a nice cylinder under my feet, kick off it and fly back up there!

427
00:20:40,060 --> 00:20:41,060
I can do that, right?

428
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:42,060
Of course I can!

429
00:20:42,060 --> 00:20:44,060
I'm immortal, I can do whatever I want!

430
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:46,060
I'm cylinder!

431
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:49,060
Wrong place again!

432
00:20:54,060 --> 00:20:56,060
A truly impressive screw up, even for him.

433
00:20:57,060 --> 00:21:00,060
My first fight in 200 years, and I screwed it up.

434
00:21:00,060 --> 00:21:01,060
I'll get it right next time.

435
00:21:01,060 --> 00:21:02,060
I just need some practice.

436
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:04,060
Yeah, just a little bit.

437
00:21:04,060 --> 00:21:08,060
I've seen enough to convince me.

438
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:13,060
If I continue my research on black blood, I am certain I can create a Kishin.

439
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:16,060
Are you sure you're gonna be all right?

440
00:21:16,060 --> 00:21:17,060
Yeah, I'm fine.

441
00:21:17,060 --> 00:21:18,060
Thanks.

442
00:21:18,060 --> 00:21:22,060
From the way your hands look, I'm guessing I'll be the one on cooking duty for a while, huh?

443
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:24,060
Heh, that oughta be interesting.

444
00:21:32,060 --> 00:21:34,060
Black blood?

445
00:21:34,060 --> 00:21:35,060
Blood?

446
00:21:35,060 --> 00:21:36,060
Blood?

447
00:21:36,060 --> 00:22:00,060
Kuzu-boshi, kira-me-ku, yume-no, hoshi-sa, I wanna be, y'kou-ze, y'kou-ze, y'kou-ze!

448
00:22:06,060 --> 00:22:12,160
I wanna be, y'kou-ze, y'kou-ze, y'kou-ze!

449
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:42,140
Thank you.

450
00:22:42,160 --> 00:23:12,140
Thank you.

451
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:14,200
I love karaoke, too. I feel a star moment coming on.

452
00:23:14,380 --> 00:23:16,500
So, should we eat fish and chips or fish and chips?

453
00:23:16,580 --> 00:23:18,100
Food, karaoke, then sightseeing!

454
00:23:18,420 --> 00:23:20,740
If we're feeling crazy, we could try some bangers and mash.

455
00:23:20,780 --> 00:23:23,120
I'm kind of tired. Maybe I'll just go home and watch TV.

456
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:26,740
On the next episode of Soul Eater, the super-written exam.

457
00:23:27,060 --> 00:23:28,840
Heart-bounding, reeling, and restless? You're kidding.

458
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:30,860
What? We have a test next week?

459
00:23:31,380 --> 00:23:32,900
Oh, man, that spoiled my appetite.

460
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:34,400
No Yorkshire pudding for me.

